WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:04.460
Have you ever wondered about the deepest desire
of SCP-811, or the Swamp Woman?

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:11.019
Foundation scientists used SCP-978, the Desire
Camera, to snap a picture of SCP-811 while

00:00:11.019 --> 00:00:13.700
she was looking at the camera, and this was
the result:

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:19.429
"A human woman with the same height, build,
and facial features as SCP-811, braiding yellow

00:00:19.429 --> 00:00:22.649
ribbons into her hair and wearing a blue sundress."

00:00:22.649 --> 00:00:28.239
Sadly, it seems like all SCP-811 wants is
to be an ordinary human woman, something she

00:00:28.239 --> 00:00:30.929
will probably never get to experience again.

